  steps: [
    { math: '1 · Germs: bacteria, viruses, fungi, parasites', note: 'Bacteria are cells (antibiotics attack their machinery); viruses are genetic hijackers (antibiotics useless — antivirals or vaccines instead). Different enemies, different weapons.' },
